# At low contrast the scalar index sits between the two polarisations.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy.
title Silicon nitride 1000 x 400 nm, scalar field
grid dx=0.05 dy=0.04
window width=6.0 ymin=-2.0 ymax=2.4
rect sin -0.5 0.5 0 0.4
symmetry even
field scalar
expect neff 1.662096332 2e-8
expect group_index 2.042061284 2e-6
expect confinement 0.658751049 1e-6
expect area 0.700728847 1e-5
expect guided yes
expect cells 6600
